    <bpmn:process id="W_W4593" name="W4593. Certified Pre-Owned Listing, Content &amp; Channel Syndication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Item certified (W4589); listing cycle
Frequency: Per item + ongoing
Volume: Listings across certified resaleable items
Owner: Merchandising (VS-01) / PIM (VS-137) / Ecommerce (VS-10)
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Auto-ID (VS-151), Pricing (VS-01.2), Marketplace (VS-65)
Source: workflow W4593 — Certified Pre-Owned Listing, Content &amp; Channel Syndication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4593_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4593_Lane1" name="Merchandising">
