        <bpmn:outgoing>W4593_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4593_Task6" name="Merchandising/PIM create the certified-pre-owned listing (grade, condition…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising/PIM create the certified-pre-owned listing (grade, condition description, photos, certified warranty W4583, price W4581, serial), clearly marked &quot;certified pre-owned&quot;
Responsible (R): Merchandising / PIM
Accountable (A): VP Merch
Duration: Per item</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4593_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4593_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4593_Task7" name="Ecommerce/Marketplace syndicate the listing to channels (web VS-10, marketplace…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ecommerce/Marketplace syndicate the listing to channels (web VS-10, marketplace VS-65, in-store VS-07, loyalty VS-13), with accurate availability (VS-05/W4584)
Responsible (R): Ecommerce / Marketplace / Stores
Accountable (A): VP Merch / CMO
Duration: Per item</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4593_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4593_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4593_Task8" name="Marketing/Merchandising manage listing lifecycle (refresh, de-list on sale…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Marketing/Merchandising manage listing lifecycle (refresh, de-list on sale, re-grade on aging), and ensure no misrepresentation as new (VS-118/VS-22)
Responsible (R): Marketing / Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Merch / CMO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4593_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4593_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4593_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4593_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4593_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-697 (ensure controlled execution — Resale Listing, Fulfillment, Warranty &amp; Analytics (PA-155.3).) | - CTL-697: listings clearly &quot;certified pre-owned&quot; (not new) (VS-118/VS-22); availability accurate (VS-05); lifecycle managed
Owner: Merchandising (VS-01) / PIM (VS-137) / Ecommerce (VS-10)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
