      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4595_Task6" name="Stores/Inventory pick the specific certified serial-unit (VS-05/W4584), verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Stores/Inventory pick the specific certified serial-unit (VS-05/W4584), verify identity/grade before handover, and stage for pickup/ship
Responsible (R): Stores / Inventory
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4595_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4595_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4595_Task7" name="Logistics/Ecommerce fulfill (BOPIS pickup VS-10, or delivery VS-06/VS-60), with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics/Ecommerce fulfill (BOPIS pickup VS-10, or delivery VS-06/VS-60), with the correct serial-unit (not a different unit) and certificate/warranty
Responsible (R): Logistics / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager / Ecommerce Lead
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4595_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4595_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4595_Task8" name="Customer Support/CRM confirm receipt, capture satisfaction/review (W4598), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer Support/CRM confirm receipt, capture satisfaction/review (W4598), and register the warranty to the new owner (VS-53/W4583)
Responsible (R): Customer Support / CRM
Accountable (A): Customer Support Lead
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4595_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4595_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4595_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4595_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
