        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-697 (ensure controlled execution — Resale Listing, Fulfillment, Warranty &amp; Analytics (PA-155.3).) | - CTL-697: performance measured vs baseline (W4577); valuation tuned on accuracy; yield/margin tracked; board-reported (VS-36)
Owner: Data (VS-28) / Finance (VS-17.4) / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
